@startuml ARCH-02b-服务端逻辑分层与职责图
' 课堂汇报拆分图，来源：../ARCH-02-逻辑架构图.puml 与 ../ARCH-03-进程与通信边界图.puml
!pragma layout smetana
title 服务端逻辑分层、服务职责与通信
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

cloud "Android / Windows 客户端" as Client #E1F5FE
component "HTTPS Ingress\nTLS、限流、路由" as Ingress #ECEFF1

package "三个粗粒度责任单元" #F8F9FA {
  component "身份与同步\n账号、设备、幂等\nrevision / cursor / tombstone" as Sync #E8F3EF
  component "AI / RAG 网关\n证据合同、ModelAdapter\nSSE 与轮询降级" as AI #FFF1E5
  component "任务与审计 Worker\nlease、重试、清理\n内容无关审计" as Worker #EDE7F6
}

database "PostgreSQL\n当前态、变更流、任务表" as PG #ECEFF1
cloud "受控模型供应商" as Model #FFF3E0

Client --> Ingress : HTTPS REST / SSE
Ingress --> Sync : 同步 API
Ingress --> AI : 问答 API
Sync --> PG : 单事务写入
AI --> PG : 请求状态与审计
Worker --> PG : lease 抢占
AI --> Model : 适配器调用

note bottom of Worker
一期可同机部署。逻辑边界用于隔离责任、故障和数据，
不等于必须拆成三个独立微服务。
end note
@enduml
